[node name="FloatingBarButton" type="Button"]
editor_description = "Shared floating capsule of every outgame bottom action bar (뒤로 / 다음 / 확인 …). Colour + font = the Bar*Button variation (BarPrimaryButton orange, BarDarkButton secondary); the drop shadow = the inspector sliders shadow_strength / shadow_size / shadow_offset_y on this root (FloatingBarButton.gd) — change them here to retune every bottom button. Hosts instance it as FloatingBarButton_<Role> inside the bar and place the row with OutgameTheme.fit_bottom_bar."
